			title: "The Treasure Layer"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0762C4053BFAD78C", "5D8FE8F2CB87C6DA"]
			description: [
				"Waystones, Sophisticated Backpacks, Tom's Simple Storage, Storage Drawers, Carry On, Comforts, FallingTree, right-click harvesting and the crafting helpers reduce repetitive work."
				"Performance mods such as ModernFix, FerriteCore, AI Improvements, Alternate Current and Clumps protect memory or tick time. Distant Horizons draws far terrain without asking the server to fully simulate it."
				"Utility does not mean free power. Label shared storage, agree before moving another player's blocks and use long-distance tools to support roads and expeditions rather than erase them."
				"Library, compatibility, and performance mods may appear in the installed list without their own adventure chapter. They support the experience; they are not missing content that players need to craft or conquer."
			]
			id: "78EB0B22EC380E61"
			rewards: [{
